From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tompta1 <546706+tompta1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 11:39:55 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: iommu: allow the T8011 legacy DART compatible

T8011 PCIe uses the existing legacy Apple DART implementation with a chip-specific compatible and the S5L8960X fallback.

[Orchard: from OrchardLinux/orchard#205 (tompta1, 09038adf),
 kernel/patches/drivers/iommu/0015-dt-bindings-iommu-allow-the-T8011-legacy-DART-compat.patch; rebased onto main, otherwise unchanged.]

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/apple,dart.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/apple,dart.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/apple,dart.yaml
index 9bbc29f33..dee8c93b2 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/apple,dart.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/apple,dart.yaml
@@ -37,6 +37,7 @@ properties:
               - apple,t7000-dart
               - apple,s8000-dart
               - apple,t8010-dart
+              - apple,t8011-dart
               - apple,t8015-dart
           - const: apple,s5l8960x-dart
 
